    "title": "_Tardigrade_",
    "subtitle": "Always fashionably _late_. Never boring.",
    "abstract": "Tardigrades display complex party behaviors with species-specific social patterns. Party water bears arrive earliest and show sophisticated dance moves. During social gatherings, survival mechanisms are suppressed, with no tun formation observed—a phenomenon (see [](https://www.doi.org/10.5555/mock.19)) we term FOMO-biosis."
